{"id":"n44187-1-7","stage":2,"title":"담백하다 · 坦率","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44187-1-7-1","ko":"민준이의 성격은 어때?","zh":"敏俊的性格怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이의","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"민준이의","audio":"/audio/b279178de14757126dfc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이의","audio":"/audio/b279178de14757126dfc.mp3"}},{"text":"성격은","meaning":"性格","explanation":"성격：性格；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"성격","audio":"/audio/9b3edda555d03500b72a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62821","senseId":"1","lemma":"성격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성격은","audio":"/audio/ba838cadf25d31c046f0.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9b3edda555d03500","term":"성격","zh":"性格","audio":"/audio/9b3edda555d03500b72a.mp3","entryId":"62821","definition":"个人具有的固有脾气或品性。","pronunciation":["성ː껵"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/90f1ad8deee43ccae04c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44187-1-7-2","ko":"솔직하고 담백해서 남에게 거짓말을 하지 않아.","zh":"他很诚实直率，从不会对别人说谎。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"솔직하고","meaning":"坦诚，坦率","explanation":"솔직하다：坦诚，坦率；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"솔직하다","audio":"/audio/c86a5bfccc9f530c41cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85310","senseId":"1","lemma":"솔직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솔직하고","audio":"/audio/0b97a6c1d48938f58645.mp3"}},{"text":"담백해서","meaning":"坦率，率真，坦白","explanation":"담백하다：坦率，率真，坦白；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"담백하다","audio":"/audio/6ef5f87eb9f0a25445e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44187","senseId":"1","lemma":"담백하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담백해서","audio":"/audio/a52e3019647bd91b1847.mp3"}},{"text":"남에게","meaning":"别人，他人，人家","explanation":"남：别人，他人，人家；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"남","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28394","senseId":"1","lemma":"남","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남에게","audio":"/audio/9376c4f9b308d91fe3ea.mp3"}},{"text":"거짓말을","meaning":"谎言","explanation":"거짓말：谎言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거짓말","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28444","senseId":"1","lemma":"거짓말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거짓말을","audio":"/audio/d3ba155f5ff828e91261.mp3"}},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"않아.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아","audio":"/audio/691c8d98a5312caac1ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c86a5bfccc9f530c","term":"솔직하다","zh":"坦诚，坦率","audio":"/audio/c86a5bfccc9f530c41cb.mp3","entryId":"85310","definition":"不虚伪，不做作。","pronunciation":["솔찌카다"]},{"id":"6ef5f87eb9f0a254","term":"담백하다","zh":"坦率，率真，坦白","audio":"/audio/6ef5f87eb9f0a25445e3.mp3","entryId":"44187","definition":"没有欲望，心灵纯真直率。","pronunciation":["담ː배카다"]},{"id":"e43a28aa552de482","term":"남","zh":"别人，他人，人家","audio":"/audio/e43a28aa552de4826029.mp3","entryId":"28394","definition":"除我之外的其他人。","pronunciation":["남"]},{"id":"a142bcee838500ea","term":"거짓말","zh":"谎言","audio":"/audio/a142bcee838500ead54b.mp3","entryId":"28444","definition":"把非事实的事情编造成事实一样说的话。","pronunciation":["거ː진말"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1bb6a76e3bb139ddff82.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.738,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=44187","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3914,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["敏俊的性格怎么样？","他很诚实直率，从不会对别人说谎。","你爸爸从外面带了个女人回来。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏俊的性格怎么样？","他很诚实直率，从不会对别人说谎。","你爸爸从外面带了个女人回来。"],"answer":1}]}
